#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "Input-Method-V1 Protocol"
msgstr "Input-Method-V1 协议"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid ""
"An implementation of the input-method-v1 protocol. Needed for proper "
"functioning of input methods like Fcitx5."
msgstr "input-method-v1 协议的实现。Fcitx5 等输入法需要此协议才能正常工作。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid ""
"Enable support for the text-input-v1 protocol, used predominantly by "
"Chromium and Electron apps."
msgstr "启用对 text-input-v1 协议的支持，该协议主要被 Chromium 和 Electron 应用使用。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Enable support for the text-input-v3 protocol."
msgstr "启用对 text-input-v3 协议的支持。"
